desc: Number 100 ids 1..N, then set each cap to id*50
category: expert
par: 49
hint1: One column wants a block and a g-flavored increment; the other wants the engine to do the math.
hint2: A zero-width anchor lets the replacement see the freshly-minted id; submatch is your calculator.
